+            </div>
+          </div>
+        </div>
+
+        <div class="example">
+          <button class="question" type="button" aria-expanded="false">
+            <span class="question-text">Why do cats knead with their paws?</span>
+            <span class="chevron" aria-hidden="true"></span>
+          </button>
+          <div class="details" hidden>
+            <div class="details-inner">
+              <p>Kneading is a soothing behavior linked to kittenhood. Adult cats often do it when relaxed, comfortable, or marking a favorite spot.</p>
+            </div>
+          </div>
+        </div>
+
+        <div class="example">
+          <button class="question" type="button" aria-expanded="false">
+            <span class="question-text">What should I feed my cat?</span>
+            <span class="chevron" aria-hidden="true"></span>
+          </button>
+          <div class="details" hidden>
+            <div class="details-inner">
